// Stage 2 battle map: two Ant colonies, Ant Soldiers only.
//
// PROVISIONAL RULE: `melee_can_damage_colonies: true` lets the Ant Soldiers (melee) damage colonies
// so that this soldier-only battle can end with a capture. OpenSA/original rule is that melee units
// cannot harm colonies (docs/GAMEPLAY_RESEARCH.md, verified item 3 / assumption A6). Every other map
// leaves this false.
(
    name: "Ant Skirmish",
    description: "Yellow (you) versus Red (bot). Capture the red colony: destroy it, then collect more of its bits than the enemy.",
    width: 64,
    height: 64,
    tileset: "normal",
    seed: 20261013,
    terrain: [
        (kind: Vegetation, center: (32.0, 32.0), radius: 5.0),
